  "source": "uml ropSequences \"Интеграционные сценарии РОП\"\ninteraction D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction \"Последовательность обновления предложений\"\ndiagram D22_sequence_suppliers \"Последовательность обновления предложений\" interaction=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction type=sequence\nactor D22_sequence_suppliers.participantType0 \"Сотрудник склада\"\nlifeline D22_sequence_suppliers.lane0 \"Сотрудник склада\" classifier=D22_sequence_suppliers.participantType0 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction\nview view_0cdcfe9a4bbb \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane0\ncomponent D22_sequence_suppliers.participantType1 \"Web / API\"\nlifeline D22_sequence_suppliers.lane1 \"Web / API\" classifier=D22_sequence_suppliers.participantType1 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction\nview view_65742470c94c \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane1\ncomponent D22_sequence_suppliers.participantType2 \"Сервис предложений\"\nlifeline D22_sequence_suppliers.lane2 \"Сервис предложений\" classifier=D22_sequence_suppliers.participantType2 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction\nview view_bfdd28339d65 \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane2\ncomponent D22_sequence_suppliers.participantType3 Адаптер\nlifeline D22_sequence_suppliers.lane3 Адаптер classifier=D22_sequence_suppliers.participantType3 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction\nview view_56f36736cdf3 \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane3\ncomponent D22_sequence_suppliers.participantType4 Поставщик\nlifeline D22_sequence_suppliers.lane4 Поставщик classifier=D22_sequence_suppliers.participantType4 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction\nview view_2ed5cad9bd1b \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane4\ncomponent D22_sequence_suppliers.participantType5 PostgreSQL\nlifeline D22_sequence_suppliers.lane5 PostgreSQL classifier=D22_sequence_suppliers.participantType5 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction\nview view_67c8eb8456ed \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane5\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m1Send \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane0 order=0 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m1Receive \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane1 order=1 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction\nmessage D22_sequence_suppliers.m1 \"Обновить выбранного поставщика; HTTPS / JSON\" owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction receive=D22_sequence_suppliers.m1Receive send=D22_sequence_suppliers.m1Send sequence=1 sort=synchCall\nview view_ae3bacfe3af0 \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.m1\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m2Send \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane1 order=2 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m2Receive \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane2 order=3 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction\nmessage D22_sequence_suppliers.m2 \"Проверить роль STOCK; начать импорт\" owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction receive=D22_sequence_suppliers.m2Receive send=D22_sequence_suppliers.m2Send sequence=2 sort=asynchCall\nview view_c8e8001b2230 \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.m2\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m3Send \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane1 order=4 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m3Receive \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane0 order=5 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction\nmessage D22_sequence_suppliers.m3 \"Импорт принят в фоновую обработку\" owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction receive=D22_sequence_suppliers.m3Receive replyTo=D22_sequence_suppliers.m1 send=D22_sequence_suppliers.m3Send sequence=3 sort=reply\nview view_e23f7f366528 \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.m3\nfragment D22_sequence_suppliers.retry \"Первая попытка и до 3 отложенных повторов\" operator=loop order=6 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction\ncoverage D22_sequence_suppliers.retryCover0 \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane0 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.retry\ncoverage D22_sequence_suppliers.retryCover1 \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane1 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.retry\ncoverage D22_sequence_suppliers.retryCover2 \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane2 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.retry\ncoverage D22_sequence_suppliers.retryCover3 \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane3 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.retry\ncoverage D22_sequence_suppliers.retryCover4 \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane4 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.retry\ncoverage D22_sequence_suppliers.retryCover5 \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane5 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.retry\nview view_baea759ae7d6 \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.retry\noperand D22_sequence_suppliers.retryBody \"\" guard=\"не завершено и попытка ≤ 4; дождаться next_attempt_at / срока сервера\" max=4 min=1 order=0 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.retry\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m4Send \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane2 order=7 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.retryBody\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m4Receive \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane3 order=8 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.retryBody\nmessage D22_sequence_suppliers.m4 \"Запросить свежие предложения\" owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction receive=D22_sequence_suppliers.m4Receive send=D22_sequence_suppliers.m4Send sequence=4 sort=synchCall\nview view_7b822acee7f3 \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.m4\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m5Send \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane3 order=9 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.retryBody\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m5Receive \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane4 order=10 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.retryBody\nmessage D22_sequence_suppliers.m5 \"HTTPS; согласованный JSON/файл\" owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction receive=D22_sequence_suppliers.m5Receive send=D22_sequence_suppliers.m5Send sequence=5 sort=synchCall\nview view_45a5eca5fbce \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.m5\nfragment D22_sequence_suppliers.outcome \"Результат получения предложений\" operator=alt order=11 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.retryBody\ncoverage D22_sequence_suppliers.outcomeCover0 \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane0 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.outcome\ncoverage D22_sequence_suppliers.outcomeCover1 \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane1 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.outcome\ncoverage D22_sequence_suppliers.outcomeCover2 \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane2 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.outcome\ncoverage D22_sequence_suppliers.outcomeCover3 \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane3 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.outcome\ncoverage D22_sequence_suppliers.outcomeCover4 \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane4 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.outcome\ncoverage D22_sequence_suppliers.outcomeCover5 \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane5 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.outcome\nview view_3735ea3b217e \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.outcome\noperand D22_sequence_suppliers.received \"\" guard=\"получены данные\" order=0 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.outcome\noperand D22_sequence_suppliers.temporary \"\" guard=\"тайм-аут либо 429 либо 5xx\" order=1 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.outcome\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m6Send \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane4 order=12 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.received\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m6Receive \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane3 order=13 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.received\nmessage D22_sequence_suppliers.m6 \"Ответ с ценами, остатками и временем\" owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction receive=D22_sequence_suppliers.m6Receive replyTo=D22_sequence_suppliers.m5 send=D22_sequence_suppliers.m6Send sequence=6 sort=reply\nview view_27d829b424f0 \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.m6\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m7Send \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane3 order=14 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.received\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m7Receive \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane2 order=15 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.received\nmessage D22_sequence_suppliers.m7 \"Проверенные записи и неизвестные SKU\" owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction receive=D22_sequence_suppliers.m7Receive replyTo=D22_sequence_suppliers.m4 send=D22_sequence_suppliers.m7Send sequence=7 sort=reply\nview view_453a2537e483 \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.m7\nfragment D22_sequence_suppliers.validation \"Валидация полученных записей\" operator=alt order=16 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.received\ncoverage D22_sequence_suppliers.validationCover0 \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane0 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.validation\ncoverage D22_sequence_suppliers.validationCover1 \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane1 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.validation\ncoverage D22_sequence_suppliers.validationCover2 \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane2 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.validation\ncoverage D22_sequence_suppliers.validationCover3 \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane3 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.validation\ncoverage D22_sequence_suppliers.validationCover4 \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane4 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.validation\ncoverage D22_sequence_suppliers.validationCover5 \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane5 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.validation\nview view_ae5f76bd9466 \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.validation\noperand D22_sequence_suppliers.validRecords \"\" guard=\"есть корректные сопоставленные записи\" order=0 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.validation\noperand D22_sequence_suppliers.invalidRecords \"\" guard=else order=1 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.validation\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m8Send \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane2 order=17 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.validRecords\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m8Receive \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane5 order=18 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.validRecords\nmessage D22_sequence_suppliers.m8 \"Транзакция: добавить снимки предложений\" owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction receive=D22_sequence_suppliers.m8Receive send=D22_sequence_suppliers.m8Send sequence=8 sort=synchCall\nview view_2a4d1d793cb8 \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.m8\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m9Send \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane2 order=19 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.validRecords\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m9Receive \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane5 order=20 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.validRecords\nmessage D22_sequence_suppliers.m9 \"Зависимые карточки → STALE; аудит\" owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction receive=D22_sequence_suppliers.m9Receive send=D22_sequence_suppliers.m9Send sequence=9 sort=synchCall\nview view_ddd7143ffe27 \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.m9\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m10Send \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane2 order=21 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.invalidRecords\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m10Receive \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane5 order=22 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.invalidRecords\nmessage D22_sequence_suppliers.m10 \"Не принимать неверные записи; сохранить причины и прежнюю дату\" owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction receive=D22_sequence_suppliers.m10Receive send=D22_sequence_suppliers.m10Send sequence=10 sort=synchCall\nview view_b30e7f86be2e \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.m10\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m11Send \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane2 order=23 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.received\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m11Receive \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane1 order=24 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.received\nmessage D22_sequence_suppliers.m11 \"Сводка: принято / отклонено\" owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction receive=D22_sequence_suppliers.m11Receive send=D22_sequence_suppliers.m11Send sequence=11 sort=asynchSignal\nview view_1ec74112fad3 \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.m11\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m12Send \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane1 order=25 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.received\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m12Receive \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane0 order=26 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.received\nmessage D22_sequence_suppliers.m12 \"Показать дату и ошибки сопоставления\" owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction receive=D22_sequence_suppliers.m12Receive send=D22_sequence_suppliers.m12Send sequence=12 sort=asynchSignal\nview view_9d91f67eeb5e \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.m12\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m13Send \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane3 order=27 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.temporary\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m13Receive \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane2 order=28 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.temporary\nmessage D22_sequence_suppliers.m13 \"Тайм-аут / 429 / 5xx: отложенный повтор\" owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction receive=D22_sequence_suppliers.m13Receive replyTo=D22_sequence_suppliers.m4 send=D22_sequence_suppliers.m13Send sequence=13 sort=reply\nview view_2c21c0f8cf95 \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.m13\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m14Send \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane2 order=29 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.temporary\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m14Receive \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane1 order=30 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.temporary\nmessage D22_sequence_suppliers.m14 \"Старые данные сохранены с прежней датой\" owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction receive=D22_sequence_suppliers.m14Receive send=D22_sequence_suppliers.m14Send sequence=14 sort=asynchSignal\nview view_406e6918a4d1 \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.m14\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m15Send \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane2 order=31 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.temporary\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m15Receive \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane5 order=32 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.temporary\nmessage D22_sequence_suppliers.m15 \"Записать retry_count, next_attempt_at и причину; после 3 повторов завершить с ошибкой\" owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction receive=D22_sequence_suppliers.m15Receive send=D22_sequence_suppliers.m15Send sequence=15 sort=synchCall\nview view_a28743148eb2 \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.m15\nannotation D22_sequence_suppliers.fallback \"Если согласованный автоматический канал недоступен, сотрудник загружает файл через тот же этап валидации. Наличие публичного API поставщиков не предполагается.\"\nview view_622c20dec3b9 \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.fallback\nannotation D22_sequence_suppliers.note \"Сообщения описывают сценарий, а не собственную спецификацию API. Имена методов и реальные endpoint не задаются. Пунктир — ответ.\\nЛокальная уникальность operation_key не гарантирует exactly-once во внешнем сервисе.\"\nview view_bd8d6b88d5e0 \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.note\ninteraction D23_sequence_ozon.interaction \"Последовательность публикации версии карточки\"\ndiagram D23_sequence_ozon \"Последовательность публикации версии карточки\" interaction=D23_sequence_ozon.interaction type=sequence\nactor D23_sequence_ozon.participantType0 Менеджер\nlifeline D23_sequence_ozon.lane0 Менеджер classifier=D23_sequence_ozon.participantType0 owner=D23_sequence_ozon.interaction\nview view_e8b8102652d0 \"\" diagram=D23_sequence_ozon element=D23_sequence_ozon.lane0\ncomponent D23_sequence